# Stable spec ID: iba-sazerac. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(brandy; Cognac) 50 ml
(absinthe) 10 ml
(sugar, cube) 1
(bitters @ Peychaud's) 2 dashes

::equipment
(old-fashioned glass)
(mixing glass)

::instructions
(old-fashioned glass) <chill> <rinse, with (absinthe)> <fill, with crushed ice> <set aside>
{drink} = (brandy; Cognac) + (sugar, cube) + (bitters @ Peychaud's)
{drink} <stir, with ice in (mixing glass)>
(old-fashioned glass) <empty, discarding preparation ice and excess absinthe>
{drink} <strain, into the prepared glass>
<garnish, with lemon zest>

